Hi all,

I ran my code a few times last night but no luck recreating the error. Last week I got it 10 times in a row. There's definitely something strange going on but I have no idea what. I'm using simulated data with a highly identified Jolly-Seber multievent model. Everything converges on the simulated parameters, just sometimes the derived superpopulation goes haywire. That's all I know! I just responded to Diego because I recognised the behaviour.

Matt

